//
// Vendored code is linted by its own project; ours is held to -Wall.
// The OPL2's truncating assignments are how a fixed-point pipeline is
// written, and its files carry a timescale ours do not.
//
// GENUNNAMED and UNOPTFLAT are raised during elaboration, where -file
// does not scope them, so they are off by rule. That is broader than it
// looks: this file is passed only to the targets that build the OPL2,
// the way hazard3.vlt is, so no other module loses the check. UNOPTFLAT
// here is the operator bank's array read as a loop it is not.
`verilator_config
lint_off -file "*opl2_fpga*"
lint_off -rule TIMESCALEMOD
lint_off -rule GENUNNAMED
lint_off -rule UNOPTFLAT
